s severe? Hard.\n\nWe could propose Candidate B as a stronger alternative, citing stress resilience and technical competence, and argue that communication tone can be coached, while egocentric and unwillingness to further education is more ingrained.\n\nThus we can change vote to Candidate B. Provide evidence: very conscientious (reliability), handles stress very well (stress resilience), good at assessing weather (technical competence), excellent computer skills (technical). Concerns: pretentious, wrong tone (crew cooperation, communication). Compare to Candidate C: reliability and decision speed, but egocentric and unwillingness to further education (adaptability). Argue that stress resilience is critical for long-distance flights, and that communication tone can be improved, while egocentric attitude may be more problematic.\n\nThus we can state provisional recommendation: Candidate B.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 1's points. Provide explicit facts.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate B\"."}
